<speak>That would be useful. When I go to a meeting, I sometimes bring every question I have accumulated for months because I do not know when I will ask again. Then we spend half the time on something simple that could have gone elsewhere. If I know there is a proper route for ordinary interface help, I will use it. I do not need you personally to explain where every button is. I mainly want to know whom to contact, and to avoid being passed around without a clear reason. A little organisation at the beginning usually saves everybody time later.</speak>